{"id":"657088","name":"广式腊肠炒饭","author":"宁静致远0217","authorId":"9691953","desc":"","cover":"images/657088/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"剩米饭","amount":"1碗"},{"name":"广式腊肠","amount":"2根"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}],"sub":[{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"木耳泡发。","img":"images/657088/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"腊肠去皮切小丁儿。","img":"images/657088/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"木耳切块，鸡蛋打散。","img":"images/657088/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅中放油炒鸡蛋。","img":"images/657088/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"成型捞出备用。","img":"images/657088/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中留油炒腊肠丁儿出香味。","img":"images/657088/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入米饭煸炒两分钟。","img":"images/657088/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入木耳煸炒半分钟。","img":"images/657088/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加入炒好的鸡蛋炒散，然后加入两勺盐炒匀。","img":"images/657088/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"盛出即可。","img":"images/657088/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}